\pard\li360\fi-180\sa60\f0\fs21\
\u8226? setup.sh, up.sh, down.sh, status.sh : d\u233?marrage, \u233?tat et arr\u234?t local. setup.sh g\u232?re les profils; up.sh lance l\u8217?application de base; down.sh conserve les volumes; status.sh montre Compose et interroge l\u8217?API.\par

\pard\li360\fi-180\sa60\f0\fs21\
